Document: LM2596 DC-DC Buck Converter Step-Down Module Schematics
Input Voltage: 4.0V - 40V DC
Output Voltage: 1.25V - 37V DC (Adjustable via multi-turn potentiometer)
Max Output Current: 3A (Heatsink recommended for > 2A)
Conversion Efficiency: Up to 92%
Switching Frequency: 150kHz
Status: Public Technical Documentation
